<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The dataset used in this project was obtained from Kaggle and contains 6700 records with 14 attributes, including the target variable quartile_zone, which classifies each house into one of four price categories. The dataset includes various property related features such as price, number of bedrooms, grade, living area size , real bathrooms, renovation status, basement availability, view quality, condition quality, single floor structure, and time related information such as date and month. This dataset provides a diverse range of characteristics that help analyze property value and support the classification task in this project.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
